# The Jagex launcher AppImage is 140 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit, and was
# stripped from history on 2026-10-14. Keep it on disk for
# `nix-shell pkgs/jagex-launcher` (plain nix, so untracked files still work),
# but never commit it. A copy lives in ~/backups/jagex/.
pkgs/jagex-launcher/*.AppImage
